F56; color:#000000\">S\u00e9lection en \u00e9quipe nationale **</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">2022-</td><td valign=\"top\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Flag_of_Puerto_Rico.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Drapeau : Porto Rico\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Flag_of_Puerto_Rico.svg/20px-Flag_of_Puerto_Rico.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Flag_of_Puerto_Rico.svg/40px-Flag_of_Puerto_Rico.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%89quipe_de_Porto_Rico_masculine_de_basket-ball\" title=\"\u00c9quipe de Porto Rico masculine de basket-ball\">Porto Rico</a></span> (10 s\u00e9l.)</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<td colspan=\"3\"><hr style=\"height:2px; color:inherit; background-color:#DD8F56;\" /></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>* Points marqu\u00e9s dans chaque club dans le cadre de la saison r\u00e9guli\u00e8re du championnat national.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>** Points marqu\u00e9s pour l\u2019\u00e9quipe nationale en match officiel.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"navigation-only\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"border-top: 2px #DD8F56 solid; font-size: 80%; background:inherit; color: inherit; text-align: right;\"><span class=\"plainlinks\" style=\"float:left;\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\" href=\"https://fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\"><span class=\"infodoc\">modifier</span></a></span>&#160;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mod%C3%A8le:Infobox_Joueur_de_basket-ball\" title=\"Consultez la documentation du mod\u00e8le\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/20px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/40px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Ethan Ivan Thompson</b>, n\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap date-lien\" datetime=\"1999-05-04\" data-sort-value=\"1999-05-04\"><a href=\"/wiki/4_mai_en_sport\" title=\"4 mai en sport\">4 mai</a> <a href=\"/wiki/1999_en_basket-ball\" title=\"1999 en basket-ball\">1999</a></time> \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/Los_Angeles\" title=\"Los Angeles\">Los Angeles</a> en <a href=\"/wiki/Californie\" title=\"Californie\">Californie</a>, est un joueur <a href=\"/wiki/Porto_Rico\" title=\"Porto Rico\">portoricain</a> de <a href=\"/wiki/Basket-ball\" title=\"Basket-ball\">basket-ball</a> mesurant 1,93 m et \u00e9voluant au poste d'<a href=\"/wiki/Arri%C3%A8re_(basket-ball)\" title=\"Arri\u00e8re (basket-ball)\">arri\u00e8re</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Biographie\">Biographie</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Biographie\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Biographie\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Universit\u00e9\"><span id=\"Universit.C3.A9\"></span>Universit\u00e9</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Universit\u00e9\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Universit\u00e9\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bandeau-container bandeau-section metadata bandeau-niveau-information\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\"><span class=\"mw-valign-text-top noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/20px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"13\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/40px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"640\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"bandeau-cell\">Cette section est vide, insuffisamment d\u00e9taill\u00e9e ou incompl\u00e8te. <a href=\"/wiki/Sp%C3%A9cial:EditPage/Ethan_Thompson\" title=\"Sp\u00e9cial:EditPage/Ethan Thompson\">Votre aide</a> est la bienvenue&#160;! <a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Comment_modifier_une_page\" title=\"Aide:Comment modifier une page\">Comment faire&#160;?</a></div></div>\n<p>Il n'est pas s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9 lors de la <a href=\"/wiki/Draft_2021_de_la_NBA\" title=\"Draft 2021 de la NBA\">draft 2021</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Magic_d'Orlando_(f\u00e9vrier-juillet_2025)\"><span id=\"Magic_d.27Orlando_.28f.C3.A9vrier-juillet_2025.29\"></span>Magic d'Orlando (f\u00e9vrier-juillet 2025)</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Magic d&#039;Orlando (f\u00e9vrier-juillet 2025)\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Magic d&#039;Orlando (f\u00e9vrier-juillet 2025)\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>En <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2025-02\" data-sort-value=\"2025-02\">f\u00e9vrier 2025</time>, il signe un contrat <i>two-way</i> avec le <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_d%27Orlando\" title=\"Magic d&#39;Orlando\">Magic d'Orlando</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p><b>Pacers d'Indiana (f\u00e9vrier 2026-)</b>\n</p><p>Au d\u00e9but, de l'ann\u00e9e 2026, il signe un <a href=\"/wiki/Two-way_contract\" title=\"Two-way contract\">two-way contract</a> avec les <a href=\"/wiki/Pacers_de_l%27Indiana\" title=\"Pacers de l&#39;Indiana\">Pacers de l'Indiana</a>. Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2026-02-12\" data-sort-value=\"2026-02-12\">12 f\u00e9vrier 2026</time>, il joue ses premi\u00e8res minutes en NBA face aux <a href=\"/wiki/Cavaliers_de_Cleveland\" title=\"Cavaliers de Cleveland\">Cavaliers de Cleveland</a> avec 7 minutes de jeu pour 2 points et 1 passe. Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2026-04-02\" data-sort-value=\"2026-04-02\">2 avril 2026</time> face aux <a href=\"/wiki/Bulls_de_Chicago\" title=\"Bulls de Chicago\">Bulls de Chicago</a> il bat son record en carri\u00e8re avec 24 points inscrits.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Palmar\u00e8s_et_distinctions_personnelles\"><span id=\"Palmar.C3.A8s_et_distinctions_personnelles\"></span>Palmar\u00e8s et distinctions personnelles</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Palmar\u00e8s et distinctions personnelles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Palmar\u00e8s et distinctions personnelles\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>Participation au All Star Game de <a href=\"/wiki/NBA_G_League\" title=\"NBA G League\">NBA G League</a> en 2026</li>\n<li>All-NBA G League Third Team (2024)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/NBA_G_League\" title=\"NBA G League\">NBA G League</a> Next Up Game (2024)</li>\n<li>First-team All-<a href=\"/wiki/Pacific-12_Conference\" title=\"Pacific-12 Conference\">Pac-12</a> (2021)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=California_Mr._Basketball&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"California Mr. Basketball (page inexistante)\">California Mr. Basketball</a>&#160;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/California_Mr._Basketball\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:California Mr. Basketball\"><span class=\"indicateur-langue\" title=\"Article en anglais&#160;: \u00ab&#160;California Mr. Basketball&#160;\u00bb\">(en)</span></a> (2017)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Statistiques\">Statistiques</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Statistiques\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Statistiques\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"En_universit\u00e9\"><span id=\"En_universit.C3.A9\"></span>En universit\u00e9</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: En universit\u00e9\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Ethan_Thompson&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : En universit\u00e9\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Les statistiques d'Ethan Thompson en matchs universitaires sont les suivantes&#160;:\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"font-size:95%; text-align:right;\">\n<caption class=\"hidden\">\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Saison\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">\u00c9quipe\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Matchs\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Titul.\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Min./m\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">% Tir\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">% 3pts\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">% LF\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Rbds/m.\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Pass/m.\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Int/m.\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Ctr/m.\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Pts/m.\n</th><